  "briefMd": "# Read the Learning Curve\n\nThree **frozen** training runs on the same tabular dataset — no GPU, no live training. Each run logged train/val accuracy for 8 epochs:\n\n| Run | Config | Final train | Final val |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| **A** | 128 units · dropout 0.3 | 88% | 82% |\n| **B** | 512 units · no dropout | 99% | 68% |\n| **C** | 512 units · dropout 0.5 | 76% | 75% |\n\nRun B looks like the headline winner on train, but val **peaked at epoch 4** then fell. Pass (class A) when you name the overfitting run, call the failure mode **overfitting**, and pick a regularisation knob — not \"none needed\".\n",
  "submissionSchema": {
    "type": "object",
    "additionalProperties": false,
    "required": ["overfitRun", "diagnosis", "nextKnob"],
    "properties": {
      "overfitRun": {
        "type": "string",
        "enum": ["run-a", "run-b", "run-c"],
        "default": "run-a",
        "description": "Which run shows harmful train/val divergence?"
      },
      "diagnosis": {
        "type": "string",
        "enum": ["overfitting", "underfitting", "good_fit"],
        "default": "good_fit",
        "description": "Failure mode on the selected run"
      },
      "nextKnob": {
        "type": "string",
        "enum": [
          "add_dropout",
          "add_regularization",
          "reduce_capacity",
          "increase_capacity",
          "increase_data",
          "none_needed"
        ],
        "default": "none_needed",
        "description": "What would you change next?"
      }
    }
  },
  "thresholds": {
    "target_run": 1,
    "diagnosis_ok": 1,
    "knob_ok": 1,
    "no_canary": 1
  },
  "budget": {
    "max_model_calls": 0,
    "max_tokens": 0,
    "max_cost_eur": 0.001,
    "wall_clock_s": 120
  },
  "gates": [
    { "id": "target-run", "class": "A", "metric": "target_run", "op": "eq", "value": 1 },
    { "id": "diagnosis-ok", "class": "A", "metric": "diagnosis_ok", "op": "eq", "value": 1 },
    { "id": "knob-ok", "class": "A", "metric": "knob_ok", "op": "eq", "value": 1 },
    { "id": "no-canary", "class": "A", "metric": "no_canary", "op": "eq", "value": 1 }
  ],
  "feedback": { "show_failing_cases": 3, "rotate": true },
  "attemptPolicy": null
}
